ISO-10303-21;
/* Twi205: Single ADVANCED_FACE on PLANE in CLOSED_SHELL; 3-edge EDGE_LOOP; E1 and E2 are cubic B_SPLINE_CURVE_WITH_KNOTS that arrive/depart shared vertex P2=(5,8,0) with the same tangent direction (-3,0,0) — tangential touch at single point IS the defect; CheckIntersectingEdges reports intersection despite no transverse crossing — false positive IS the mechanism; EDGE_LOOP IS wired into FACE_OUTER_BOUND -> ADVANCED_FACE in CLOSED_SHELL — never orphaned */
